{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong> FriendOS</strong>, a <strong>singleplayer/online bullet-hell RPG</strong> set within a virus-infected computer. Join other Friends to face difficult challenges in a forgotten virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rally Against Viruses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/2f5c0656ec2fed773a4618ad07af210f.poster.avif?t=1760461726\" width=720 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/2f5c0656ec2fed773a4618ad07af210f.webm?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/2f5c0656ec2fed773a4618ad07af210f.mp4?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform in novel, acrobatic combat and beat down Viruses in a <strong>chaotic, metaphysical baseball arena. </strong>You can <strong>rally projectiles</strong> with other Friends to rapidly build damage, turning baseballs into weapons of mass destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/311027e91ee3f0a3c59c1247af129b97.poster.avif?t=1760461726\" width=720 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/311027e91ee3f0a3c59c1247af129b97.webm?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/311027e91ee3f0a3c59c1247af129b97.mp4?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virus combat is designed to be <strong>simple and approachable\u00a0</strong>\u2013 but the <strong>difficulty can be pushed up</strong> as far as you\u2019d like to boost your rewards. Will you let your Hubris be your downfall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your Friend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/e9d91bf38eaae975da8859a0dc68a029.poster.avif?t=1760461726\" width=720 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/e9d91bf38eaae975da8859a0dc68a029.webm?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/e9d91bf38eaae975da8859a0dc68a029.mp4?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FriendOS features a highly robust character customizer, where <strong>everything is colorizable!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>a disturbing amount of personalization </strong>over your own, beautiful Friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please <strong>mix-and-match</strong> all of your limbs and\u00a0<strong>stack hats (and more) senselessly</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FriendOS empowers you to <strong>FINALLY become the Friend of your Dreams</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>System Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/a3adff298dae2e3bcdaa25f511de79fa.poster.avif?t=1760461726\" width=720 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/a3adff298dae2e3bcdaa25f511de79fa.webm?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/a3adff298dae2e3bcdaa25f511de79fa.mp4?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out with up to <strong>12 players\u00a0</strong>in online lobbies, hosted by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into virus-infested programs in <strong>1 to 3 player dungeon raids</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the many eccentric virtual assistants of Bliss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All progression is stored locally</strong>, letting you play whenever you'd like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform in extracurricular activities, including card games and\u00a0\ud83d\udc1f\u00a0<strong>fishing\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc1f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727410?t=1760461726","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/66f1a38138ff6a498db9306a7f92c93e37fb3a3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760461726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/3faf662842f5275095a965766db3035a3d0f27a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760461726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/3faf662842f5275095a965766db3035a3d0f27a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760461726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong> FriendOS</strong>, a <strong>singleplayer/online bullet-hell RPG</strong> set within a virus-infected computer. Join other Friends to face difficult challenges in a forgotten virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rally Against Viruses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/2f5c0656ec2fed773a4618ad07af210f.poster.avif?t=1760461726\" width=720 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/2f5c0656ec2fed773a4618ad07af210f.webm?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/2f5c0656ec2fed773a4618ad07af210f.mp4?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform in novel, acrobatic combat and beat down Viruses in a <strong>chaotic, metaphysical baseball arena. </strong>You can <strong>rally projectiles</strong> with other Friends to rapidly build damage, turning baseballs into weapons of mass destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/311027e91ee3f0a3c59c1247af129b97.poster.avif?t=1760461726\" width=720 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/311027e91ee3f0a3c59c1247af129b97.webm?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/311027e91ee3f0a3c59c1247af129b97.mp4?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virus combat is designed to be <strong>simple and approachable\u00a0</strong>\u2013 but the <strong>difficulty can be pushed up</strong> as far as you\u2019d like to boost your rewards. Will you let your Hubris be your downfall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your Friend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/e9d91bf38eaae975da8859a0dc68a029.poster.avif?t=1760461726\" width=720 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/e9d91bf38eaae975da8859a0dc68a029.webm?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/e9d91bf38eaae975da8859a0dc68a029.mp4?t=1760461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FriendOS features a highly robust character customizer, where <strong>everything is colorizable!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>a disturbing amount of personalization </strong>over your own, beautiful Friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please <strong>mix-and-match</strong> all of your limbs and\u00a0<strong>stack hats (and more) senselessly</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FriendOS empowers you to <strong>FINALLY become the Friend of your Dreams</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>System Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/a3adff298dae2e3bcdaa25f511de79fa.poster.avif?t=1760461726\" width=720 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app